      <section class="editorial-chapter">
        <h2>City Classification Slabs: Class X, Y, and Z Categorization Rules</h2>
        <p>
          The classification of cities for HRA is determined by official population metrics derived from the decennial Census of India, overseen by the Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs and the Department of Expenditure (DoE):
        </p>

        <div class="city-classification-grid">
