            <p><strong>Covered Urban Agglomerations:</strong> Delhi NCR (including Noida, Gurugram, Ghaziabad, Faridabad), Greater Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Ahmedabad, and Pune.</p>
            <span class="card-footer-note">Represents the highest urban residential rental cost tier in India.</span>
          </div>

